<title>ESTONIA: NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 18.</title>
<headline>NOON RADIO HEADLINES - JUNE 18.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>These were the main headlines reported by Kuku Radio on Wednesday at noon. Reuters has not verified these reports and does not vouch for their accuracy.</p>
<p>- Tallinn stock exchange suspended trade in Rakvere meat plant shares.</p>
<p>- Tallinn city mayor wants to take the children's television show character Autotriin as a city advisor.</p>
<p>-- Tallinn newsroom, +372 620 9202/1, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
